OL,3,GNEWSABrazil World Cup winner attends
OL,4,ALeague Two match
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer footballer Roque Junior, who
OL,7,Fstarred in the Brazil side which won
OL,8,Fthe 2002 World Cup, attended a League
OL,9,FTwo fixture on Saturday.
OL,11,FJunior, who also won the Champions
OL,12,FLeague with AC Milan in 2003, watched
OL,13,Ffrom the stands as Northampton Town
OL,14,Fbeat Rochdale at Sixfields Stadium.
OL,16,FNorthampton were recently the subject
OL,17,Fof a takeover by a Brazilian consortium
OL,18,Ffeaturing Alexandre Pato - who also
OL,19,Fplayed for Brazil and AC Milan.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
