OL,3,GNEWSABrazil World Cup winner attends
OL,4,ALeague Two match
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the club confirmed to the BBC
OL,7,Fthat Junior's attendance at the 3-2 win
OL,8,Fwas made as a guest of his friend Pedro
OL,9,FPiquet, one of Northampton's new
OL,10,Fowners.
